<h1 id="aws-secrets-manager-health-check">AWS Secrets Manager Health Check</h1>
<p>This health check verifies the ability to communicate with Amazon Secrets Manager and the existence of some secrets. For more information about AWS Secrets Manager check the <a href="https://aws.amazon.com/secrets-manager/">AWS Secrets Manager Site</a></p>
<h2 id="example-usage">Example Usage</h2>
<p>With all of the following examples, you can additionally add the following parameters:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>name</code>: The health check name. Default if not specified is <code>aws secrets manager</code>.</li>
<li><code>failureStatus</code>: The <code>HealthStatus</code> that should be reported when the health check fails. Default is <code>HealthStatus.Unhealthy</code>.</li>
<li><code>tags</code>: A list of tags that can be used to filter sets of health checks.</li>
<li><code>timeout</code>: A <code>System.TimeSpan</code> representing the timeout of the check.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="basic">Basic</h3>
<h3 id="check-existence-of-a-secret-and-load-credentials-from-the-applications-default-configuration">Check existence of a secret and load credentials from the application's default configuration</h3>
<pre><code class="language-csharp">public void ConfigureServices(IServiceCollection services)
{
    services
        .AddHealthChecks()
        .AddSecretsManager(options =&gt;
        {
            options.AddSecret(&quot;secretname&quot;);
        });
}
</code></pre>
<h3 id="check-existence-of-a-secret-and-directly-pass-credentials">Check existence of a secret and directly pass credentials</h3>
<pre><code class="language-csharp">public void ConfigureServices(IServiceCollection services)
{
    services
        .AddHealthChecks()
        .AddSecretsManager(options =&gt;
        {
            options.AddSecret(&quot;secretname&quot;);
            options.Credentials = new BasicAWSCredentials(&quot;access-key&quot;, &quot;secret-key&quot;);
        });
}
</code></pre>
<h3 id="check-existence-of-a-secret-and-specify-region-endpoint">Check existence of a secret and specify region endpoint</h3>
<pre><code class="language-csharp">public void ConfigureServices(IServiceCollection services)
